# PlasticOS Deploy Validation

Enterprise Docker testing (`make test-module` / `make test-odoo`) uses the fixture in rule `36-plasticos-docker-test-fixture`. `make test-module` does not use a database named `odoo_test`.

Odoo.sh deployment is rule `98-odoo-sh-staging`.

Scoped upgrade is:

```bash
make update m=<module>
```

Activation and recovery require explicit authorization and a named runtime result. Do not treat a command exit as success without that result.
